        "sticky": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "name": "12 STICKY (boton fijo)",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "{%- comment -%} ═══ 📝 STICKY — CTA verde ganador ═══ {%- endcomment -%}\n{% assign BTN_TEXT = \"QUIERO MI PRODUCTO 🔥\" %}\n{% assign SHOW_AFTER_SCROLL = 500 %}\n{%- comment -%} ═══ ↓ NO TOCAR ↓ ═══ {%- endcomment -%}\n<style>\n#gfs-sticky-bar{position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:9997;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:10px 14px;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid #DCEAE5;box-shadow:0 -6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.14);transform:translateY(115%);transition:transform .35s ease;box-sizing:border-box;}\n#gfs-sticky-bar.gfs-visible{transform:translateY(0);}\n#gfs-sticky-bar.gfs-visible #gfs-sticky-btn{animation-play-state:running;}\n.gfs-sticky-price{display:flex;flex-direction:column;line-height:1.1;flex:0 0 auto;}\n.gfs-sticky-price .gfs-now{font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#1a1a1a;}\n.gfs-sticky-price .gfs-was{font-size:13px;color:#9a9a9a;text-decoration:line-through;}\n#gfs-sticky-btn{flex:1 1 auto;max-width:380px;height:50px;border:1px solid #fff;border-radius:16px;background:var(--cta);color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.3px;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(var(--cta-rgb),.45);animation:gfsStickyPulse 1.8s infinite;animation-play-state:paused;position:relative;overflow:hidden;}\n#gfs-sticky-btn span{position:relative;z-index:2;}\n#gfs-sticky-btn::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;top:0;left:-100%;width:60%;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,rgba(255,255,255,.45),transparent);animation:gfsStickyShine 3.5s infinite;pointer-events:none;z-index:1;}\n@keyframes gfsStickyShine{0%{left:-100%;}40%{left:140%;}100%{left:140%;}}\n#gfs-sticky-btn:active{transform:scale(.98);}\n@keyframes gfsStickyPulse{0%{transform:scale(1)}50%{transform:scale(1.03)}100%{transform:scale(1)}}\n@media(min-width:990px){#gfs-sticky-bar{justify-content:center;gap:24px;}#gfs-sticky-btn{flex:0 0 auto;width:340px;max-width:340px;}.gfs-sticky-price{align-items:flex-end;}}\n@media(max-width:749px){#gfs-sticky-bar{padding:8px 12px}.gfs-sticky-price .gfs-now{font-size:17px}#gfs-sticky-btn{height:48px;font-size:15px}}\n</style>\n<div id=\"gfs-sticky-bar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"gfs-sticky-price\"><span class=\"gfs-now\">{{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.price | money }}</span>{% if product.selected_or_first_available_variant.compare_at_price > product.selected_or_first_available_variant.price %}<span class=\"gfs-was\">{{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.compare_at_price | money }}</span>{% endif %}</div><button id=\"gfs-sticky-btn\" type=\"button\"><span>{{ BTN_TEXT }}</span></button></div>\n<script>(function(){var bar=document.getElementById('gfs-sticky-bar');var btn=document.getElementById('gfs-sticky-btn');if(!bar||!btn)return;if(bar.parentNode!==document.body){document.body.appendChild(bar);}document.body.style.paddingBottom='80px';try{var c=window.RELEASIT_BUTTON_CONFIG;if(c&&c.text){var sp=btn.querySelector('span');if(sp)sp.textContent=c.text;}}catch(e){}function onScroll(){if(window.scrollY>{{ SHOW_AFTER_SCROLL }}){bar.classList.add('gfs-visible');}else{bar.classList.remove('gfs-visible');}}window.addEventListener('scroll',onScroll,{passive:true});onScroll();btn.addEventListener('click',function(){var main=document.getElementById('custom-releasit-btn');if(main){main.click();}});})();</script>\n<!-- ════════ NOTA INTERNA (no visible para el cliente) ════════\n     Generado: (plantilla base) · GOLDEN FULL SHOPIFY v1.19 · PRODUCTO DEMO (producto-demo)\n     Tema Dawn · Colombia · MODE ambos · Rating real 5.0/3 · Teal #0E9B8E + CTA verde #1D9E06\n     Build COMPLETO: descripcion nativa OCULTA y recreada en secciones premium (escalera/como-actua/\n     resenas reales/por-que-elegir/autoridad/manifiesto/FAQ) · countdown + doble CTA activos.\n     ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->"
          }
        }
      },
